 {
  "type": "heading",
  "level": 2,
  "html": "Healing Streams TV"
 },
 {
  "type": "p",
  "level": 0,
  "html": "Healing Streams TV (HSTV) is an online healing and miracle channel that creates an atmosphere for faith and the miraculous, such that our viewers take a hold of God’s plan for divine healing and health."
 },
 {
  "type": "p",
  "level": 0,
  "html": "It is the host platform for Healing Streams Live Healing Services with Pastor Chris, a global crusade where prayer for the sick produces phenomenal results. The event is broadcast in thousands of languages, availing billions of people worldwide the opportunity to participate. Countless testimonies abound of healing from diverse ailments, including the dead being raised back to life."
 },
 {
  "type": "p",
  "level": 0,
  "html": "HSTV flagship programs include Healing Streams Testimonies Live, Real Miracles Today, Festival of Miracles, Your Healing is Now, Steps of Faith, and How to Receive a Miracle, among others."
 },
 {
  "type": "p",
  "level": 0,
  "html": "Join millions of viewers on HSTV today and experience the miraculous."
 },
 {
  "type": "button",
  "text": "Watch Live",
  "href": "https://healingstreams.tv",
  "target": "_blank"
 },
 {
  "type": "iframe",
  "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/_48-XMCU1uA?autoplay=1&mute=1&loop=1&playlist=_48-XMCU1uA&modestbranding=1"
 },
 {
  "type": "heading",
  "level": 2,
  "html": "The Pastor Chris Live Prayathon"
 },
 {
  "type": "p",
  "level": 0,
  "html": "The epochal nonstop global Pray-a-Thon with the man of God, Reverend (Dr.) Chris Oyakhilome, kicked off in earnest on Monday, January 6th 2020 and continues till the rapture."
 },
 {
  "type": "p",
  "level": 0,
  "html": "Different Church groups, Ministries, fellowships, cells and partners of the Pastor Chris Live Global Prayer Network takes turns to pray fervently for periods of 15 minutes each day, using a meticulously designed schedule. In the words of the man of God, “we are set to effect changes in the world through heartfelt, effectual fervent prayers.”<br/><br/>Follow the PastorChrisLive SuperUser on the KingsChat App to receive daily prayer posts sent out by Pastor Chris."
 },
 {
  "type": "button",
  "text": "Join the Live Prayer",
  "href": "https://www.pastorchrislive.org/v2/index.php?r=Site/Index",
  "target": "_blank"
 },
 {
  "type": "iframe",
  "src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/NV3EelOjfRk?autoplay=1&mute=1&loop=1&playlist=NV3EelOjfRk&modestbranding=1"
 },
 {
  "type": "heading",
  "level": 2,
  "html": "The Pastor Chris Live Unending Praise"
 },
 {
  "type": "p",
  "level": 0,
  "html": "The Pastor Chris Live Unending Praise is a year-long, round-the-clock chain of unending praise and worship to the Lord, with Spirit-filled songs from Loveworld."
 },
 {
  "type": "p",
  "level": 0,
  "html": "The maiden edition was held in the month of June 2022, and was a most uplifting event, which set the stage for this next phase, which begins March 27, 2023 to March 27, 2024, glory to God!"
 },
 {
  "type": "p",
  "level": 0,
  "html": "Join the praise, which will run in blocks of 30min every single hour of every day for a whole year."
 },
 {
  "type": "button",
  "text": "Join the Live Praise",
  "href": "https://unendingpraise.pastorchrislive.org/",
  "target": "_blank"
 },
